
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Candy</title>

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@500;700;900&display=swap');

*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}

body{
    font-family:Nunito,sans-serif;
    background:#fff3fa;
    color:#35152a;
}

nav{
    max-width:1100px;
    margin:auto;
    padding:25px 5%;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
}

.logo{
    font-size:24px;
    font-weight:900;
}

nav a{
    margin-left:20px;
    text-decoration:none;
    color:#9c527b;
}

.hero{
    text-align:center;
    padding:100px 20px;
}

.hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(60px,12vw,140px);
    line-height:.8;
    font-weight:900;
}

.hero h1 span{
    color:#ff5caa;
}

.hero p{
    max-width:550px;
    margin:35px auto;
    color:#9b6a84;
}

.button{
    display:inline-block;
    padding:16px 30px;
    background:#ff5caa;
    color:white;
    border-radius:50px;
    text-decoration:none;
    box-shadow:0 12px 30px #ff5caa55;
}

.grid{
    padding:0 6% 100px;
    max-width:1100px;
    margin:auto;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:20px;
}

.card{
    padding:35px;
    border-radius:35px;
    min-height:240px;
    background:white;
    box-shadow:0 15px 40px #d56a9c15;
}

.card:nth-child(2){background:#e9ddff}
.card:nth-child(3){background:#dcf8e9}

.card h2{
    margin-top:70px;
}

.card p{
    margin-top:10px;
    color:#8d7180;
}

footer{
    padding:30px;
    text-align:center;
}

@media(max-width:700px){
    .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    nav div:last-child{display:none}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<nav>
<div class="logo">candy.</div>
<div>
<a href="#">Home</a>
<a href="#">Ideas</a>
<a href="#">Contact</a>
</div>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
<h1>Make it<br><span>fun.</span></h1>
<p>
Colorful digital experiences for brands
that refuse to be boring.
</p>
<a class="button" href="#work">Let's create ✦</a>
</section>

<section class="grid" id="work">

<div class="card">
<h2>Branding</h2>
<p>Bold identities with personality.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>Websites</h2>
<p>Playful interfaces that people remember.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>Experiments</h2>
<p>Unexpected ideas turned into reality.</p>
</div>

</section>

<footer>Made with ✦ by CWS</footer>

</body>
</html>

